/* ============================================================================
   HOME  (floating game-launcher layout for the home screen)
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   NTL's E3() still renders #mybox with the same buttons (inline onclick → NTL
   functions untouched). This module removes the card, lays the buttons out
   with CSS grid and decorates them (SVG icon + label + subtext):
        [ nickname pill            (≡ saved names) ]
        [ Server chip     ]  [ Leaderboards       ]
        [ Settings        ]  [ Skin               ]
        [ Keys            ]  [ Vanced (placeholder)]
        [ third-party row (SnakeyRain …) — only if present ]
        [ PLAY  ▶ full width                       ]
   PLAY stays NTL's <input> (u9()); an overlay triangle + a short "wy-go" class
   animate on mousedown — cosmetic only. The launcher entrance animation is
   replayed every time the menu becomes visible again (e.g. after game over).
   slither.io's #nick_holder (.taho pill, inline purple bg) becomes the glass
   pill; NTL's saved-nicknames button (📜) + <ul> (children of the holder's
   parent) are moved into the holder and get SVG icons.
   Styling happens in a MutationObserver (same microtask as the DOM change →
   nothing unstyled ever paints). Until every tile exists the grid shows a
   shimmering skeleton (#wy-skel); if SnakeyRain is installed (#snakeyrain-ui)
   a ghost row waits for its button (max 8 s).
   ============================================================================ */
